novawebhook-userlinks:
{{optional}}
Used for display of the user links. Parameters
* $1 - User page link
* $2 - {{msg-mw|novawebhook-talk}}
* $3 - {{msg-mw|novawebhook-contribs}}

novawebhook-revisionlinks:
{{Optional}}
Used for display of revision links. Parameters
* $1 - {{msg-mw|novawebhook-diff}}
* $2 - {{msg-mw|novawebhook-minor}}
* $3 - {{msg-mw|novawebhook-size}}

novawebhook-size:
{{Optional}}
Used as the text for $3 in novawebhook-revisionlinks. Parameters
* $1 - Calculated revision size diff

novawebhook-blocktimeformat:
{{optional}}

The formatting used in the date() function for displaying the time a user is blocked for.

See also: https://www.php.net/manual/en/datetime.format.php
